# 데모 전용 기능(브라우저 데모 /demo). 실제 서비스에서는 비워 두세요.
DEMO_MODE=1

# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env (it holds the API key).
#   cp .env.example .env

# --- LLM ---
# mock = no AI calls, fixed fallback text (free, instant). openai = real research / scripts / story drafts.
LLM_PROVIDER=mock
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Episode research (needs a model that supports the web_search tool) and script writing; default to OPENAI_MODEL
OPENAI_RESEARCH_MODEL=
OPENAI_WRITER_MODEL=
# Reasoning models only (gpt-5*, o*): research thinks lightly, writer thinks more and writes long
OPENAI_RESEARCH_EFFORT=low
OPENAI_WRITER_EFFORT=medium
OPENAI_WRITER_VERBOSITY=high

# --- Auth (development only) ---
# Shared token the car app sends as "Authorization: Bearer <DEV_TOKEN>". Pick your own; never use in production.
DEV_TOKEN=local-development-only

# --- Storage ---
# SQLite file for listening memory, episodes, stories, music notes, diaries (empty = in-memory, lost on restart)
ROADPOD_DB=

# --- Broadcast timing ---
# Max seconds to wait for a researched episode body before airing the catalog script
BODY_WAIT_SECONDS=25
# Story Catch: seconds to wait for an answer to the follow-up question before drafting
STORY_FOLLOWUP_SECONDS=45
# Seconds of air left after the DJ asks something ("보낼까요?", "한 장면만 고른다면요?")
ANSWER_WAIT_SECONDS=10
# Music corner (royalty-free tracks in backend/roadpod/data/music): one track every N spoken body segments, 0 = off
MUSIC_EVERY=3

# --- Road diary (오늘의 Q Diary) ---
# Base of the diary link the car shows as a QR code. Must be reachable from the driver's phone.
PUBLIC_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8765
# openai = also generate an AI illustration (costs per diary). Empty = SVG illustration only.
DIARY_IMAGES=
OPENAI_IMAGE_MODEL=gpt-image-1
# 큐큐 voice. openai = the server makes each line's mp3 (needs OPENAI_API_KEY; billed per audio minute) and the car
# plays it; fish = Fish Audio custom voice (final demo video only, see FISH_*); empty = the car's own on-device voice. The car falls back to its own voice if a file is late or fails.
TTS_PROVIDER=
OPENAI_TTS_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini-tts
OPENAI_TTS_VOICE=coral
# Longest a line waits for its audio before going out without it (seconds)
TTS_WAIT_SECONDS=12
# Fish Audio (TTS_PROVIDER=fish). Costly: turn on only to record the final demo. The key goes in .env only, never in git.
FISH_API_KEY=
FISH_REFERENCE_ID=
FISH_TTS_MODEL=s2.1-pro
FISH_SPEED=1.0
# Hard cap on characters sent to Fish (cache hits are free, counted in tts_cache/fish_usage.json across restarts)
FISH_MAX_CHARS=15000
